OL,3,GNEWSAAI and council tax rises
OL,4,Aconsidered to close budget gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour years of council tax rises, job
OL,7,Flosses and greater use of artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence are among measures being
OL,9,Fconsidered to tackle a growing funding
OL,10,Fshortfall at Durham County Council.
OL,12,FThe authority has said it faces an
OL,13,F#83.7m budget gap by 2030, driven by
OL,14,Frising costs including social care,
OL,15,Fschool transport and waste management.
OL,17,FOfficers have identified #21.5m of
OL,18,Fsavings through plans to digitise
OL,19,Fservices, reduce office costs,
OL,20,Frestructure management and increase the
OL,21,Fuse of technology, while warning lower
OL,22,Ftax rises would require deeper savings.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
